# Copy to .env.local. Same Supabase project as the acharya site — the anon key is
# public by design (it ships in the browser bundle); Row Level Security is what
# protects the data. Glorifications are stored in that project's
# public.quality_reflections table and moderated from the acharya admin panel.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
